'''Maccabi Akhi Nazareth Football Club''' ({{langx|he|מועדון כדורגל מכבי אחי נצרת|Mo'adon Kaduregel Makabi Aḥi Natzrat}}; {{langx|ar|نادي كرة القدم مكابي اخاء الناصرة|Nādī Kurat al-Qadam Makābī ’Aḫā’ an-Nāṣira}}) is an Israeli [[association football|football]] club based in [[Nazareth]]. The club is currently in the {{Israeli football updater|AkhiNaz}} and plays at the [[Ilut Stadium]] in [[Ilut]] on the outskirts of the city."}}
